        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Exposes only 2 scalar measurements in `measure_morphoeval()` without Brillouin k=pi period-2 alternation index, temporal oscillation CV, chimeric WT tip occupancy, Pearson correlation p-values, or specimen CV morphometrics." ;
